{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-franck-muller-vanguard","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"franck-muller-vanguard-london-gate-dubai-marina","about":"Introducing Franck Muller Vanguard Dubai, a groundbreaking collaboration between London Gate and the iconic Swiss watchmaker Franck Muller. Rising 38 stories in the heart of Dubai Marina, this architectural marvel offers premium studios to 3-bedroom apartments inspired by the legendary Vanguard timepiece collection. Designed by Dar Design &amp; Architecture Bureau, the tower blends Swiss precision with cutting-edge modern design, creating an extraordinary waterfront lifestyle. The development features 4 basements, a ground floor with retail, 3 podium levels, and 34 residential floors—each offering panoramic views of the Marina and city skyline.More than just residences, these fully furnished luxury apartments reflect the bold spirit of innovation and sophistication. Every detail—from sleek open layouts to high-end finishes—echoes a commitment to craftsmanship and style. Exclusive amenities include a rooftop pool, serene meditation areas, a chic social lounge, and a co-working space for modern professionals. Situated in Dubai Marina, one of the city’s most dynamic neighborhoods, Franck Muller Vanguard connects residents to world-class dining, leisure, and cultural destinations, making it the perfect blend of visionary architecture and refined living. This is where timeless design meets a future-forward lifestyle.","price":1250000,"title":"Franck Muller Vanguard","bitrix":{"id":988,"pf_id":"are.2.14483","source":null,"project_id":"Franck Muller Vanguard","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Franck Muller Vanguard","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"London Gate","project_location":"Dubai Marina"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/feature_6dd69b5ffe.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr